[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]✦ OVERVIEW[/color][/b][/size]
[b]Nightreign Relic Extractor & Vessel Loadout Manager[/b] is a modern, standalone desktop tool designed specifically for [i]Elden Ring: Nightreign[/i] ([c]NR0000.co2[/c] save files). 

It empowers you to inspect your entire relic inventory, construct optimized character vessel builds (Urn, Goblet, Chalice, etc.) with color affinity matching, hotkey-swap loadouts in-game via a sleek transparent overlay HUD ([b]F10[/b]), and safely inject your custom builds directly into your save file with automatic MD5 checksum recalculation and automatic 4-backup rotation!

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]✦ KEY FEATURES[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Dark Fantasy Gamer HUD:[/color][/b] Completely overhauled modern UI inspired by Elden Ring, Discord, and Steam UI with deep void backgrounds, card panels, and glowing affinity socket rings.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]In-Game Transparent Overlay (F10):[/color][/b] Press [b]F10[/b] anytime while playing to pull up a semi-transparent HUD overlay. Switch presets on the fly without alt-tabbing!
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Vessel Loadout Builder:[/color][/b] Support for all 10 characters and all 7 vessel types. Visually configure your 3 Normal slots and 3 Deep slots with live affinity matching ([color=#E05252]Red[/color], [color=#4A90E2]Blue[/color], [color=#F5C542]Yellow[/color], [color=#3CB371]Green[/color], and [color=#9B72CF]Any[/color]) and comprehensive in-game passive effect descriptions.
[*][b][color=#5ADCA0]1-Click Save File Injection & Auto-MD5 Recalculation:[/color][/b] 100% safe. Whenever you equip a build, the tool automatically recomputes the internal MD5 checksum required by the game engine—preventing "Save Data Corrupted" warnings.
[*][b][color=#5ADCA0]4-Backup Timestamped Rotation:[/color][/b] Automatically creates timestamped [c].bak[/c] backups before every single save write (keeps up to 4 historical backups, automatically rotating the oldest).
[*][b][color=#ECC864]AI Build Architect (ChatGPT / Claude):[/color][/b] 1-click export of your current relic collection into optimized prompts for ChatGPT or Claude to design Meta, Fun, Support, or Hybrid builds, with instant JSON copy/paste import.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Relic Inventory Extractor:[/color][/b] Decrypts and exports your full relic inventory to [b]CSV[/b] and styled [b]Excel (.xlsx)[/b] spreadsheets with full multi-effect breakdown and values.
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Multi-Language Support:[/color][/b] Fully translated in [b]English[/b], [b]Français[/b], and [b]العربية[/b] (with right-to-left layout formatting).
[*][b][color=#ECC864]Zero Dependencies & Portable:[/color][/b] A single standalone executable ([c]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/c]). Requires no external mod loaders, no DLL injection, no Python, and no extra runtimes.
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]✦ HOW TO INSTALL & USE[/color][/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*][b]Download & Extract:[/b] Download the [c]NightreignRelicExtractor-v1.5.0.zip[/c] archive from the Files tab and extract [c]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/c] anywhere you like (e.g. Desktop or game directory).
[*][b]Run the App:[/b] Double-click [c]NightreignRelicExtractor.exe[/c]. It will automatically detect your active Nightreign save file in [c]%APPDATA%\Nightreign\[/c].
[*][b]Build or Equip a Loadout:[/b]
  [list]
  [*]Head to the [b]Vessel Builder[/b] tab, select your character and vessel.
  [*]Click [b]Change...[/b] on any slot to search, filter by affinity, and select from your collected relics.
  [*]Click [b]Equip & Save to Save File[/b] to inject the loadout into your save.
  [/list]
[*][b]In-Game Activation:[/b] In Elden Ring: Nightreign, quit to the Main Menu and click [b]Continue[/b] or [b]Load Game[/b]. Your character will load with the newly equipped relics!
[*][b]In-Game Overlay (F10):[/b] While the tool is running, press [b]F10[/b] anytime in-game to toggle the overlay and switch saved builds instantly.
[/list]

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#5ADCA0]✦ SAFETY & MULTIPLAYER COMPATIBILITY[/color][/b][/size]

[quote]
[b]Is this safe to use online?[/b]
Yes! Nightreign Relic Extractor operates entirely at the save-file level ([c]NR0000.co2[/c]). It does NOT hook into game memory, does NOT alter executable code, and does NOT run active background hooks that trigger Anti-Cheat.

Furthermore, other players in co-op sessions do NOT need this tool installed—your equipped relics are standard in-game items stored directly in your genuine save data.
[/quote]

[line]

[size=4][b][color=#ECC864]✦ SCREENSHOTS[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Vessel Builder (Dark Fantasy HUD):[/b] Visual slots with glowing affinity rings, real-time in-game equipped status, and quick loadout actions.
[*][b]Relic Picker & Live Inspector:[/b] Search, affinity filter pills, compatibility badges, and detailed 3-effect listings.
[*][b]In-Game Overlay HUD (F10):[/b] Semi-transparent dark void aesthetic with instant 1-click build activation and confirmation alerts.
[*][b]Preset Browser:[/b] Grid/card view with character tags, 6-slot relic effect breakdowns, and JSON AI build import.
[/list]

